{"reviews":[{"id":"B01ETV11XU-0","r":5.0,"t":"Must have for natural hair","x":"Natural girls tender headed girls  (epscially with coarse 4c hair) try this!! It made my hair really soft and It wasn\u2019t hard to detangle","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love this Line!","x":"Best conditioner ever for high porosity 4A natural hair. After a deep condition treatment my hair always feels super soft. I refuse to use any other conditioner, only if I absolutely have to. But this line of Mane Choice comes close to perfection. It took some years to find the right line of products and this one is just right.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-2","r":5.0,"t":"Mane choice is an awesome product. The detangling conditioner leaves my hair feeling ...","x":"Mane choice is an awesome product. The detangling conditioner leaves my hair feeling super soft and I am able to get a comb straight through.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-3","r":5.0,"t":"ABSOLUTE MUST","x":"My friend turned me onto this product line. Both my daughters have curly hair that is easy to tangle and a nightmare to brush in the shower...until  the Mane Choice. After the first use, I re-ordered and told everyone I know about it. My girls wont use anything else and even check to see we have a stockpile. It is especially helpful after pool and beach days. We no longer have tears and screaming. I really can't say enough. I wish I had known about this stuff as a kid.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-4","r":5.0,"t":"Does What It Claims","x":"I highly recommend this conditioner for anyone who is natural or transitioning from relaxed to natural.  I\u2019ve been transitioning for a year, and this conditioner not only makes it easier to detangle my hair but leaves it feeling incredibly soft and moisturized.  It\u2019s worth every penny.  I pair it with the Detangling Hydration Shampoo from the same line.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-5","r":5.0,"t":"A must for your hair","x":"This is great hair product. It keeps my hair moisturized and feeling soft to the touch. I use it as part of my hair daily routine and have purchased the entire set from this line.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-6","r":5.0,"t":"Juicy, bouncy, happy curls","x":"My daughter has a mix of 3b, 3c and 4a hair types and all of them LOVE this conditioner! I have never seen her little curls more bouncy and moisturized. Will def be purchasing the rest of this line. Every Mane Choice product we try is wonderful.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-7","r":5.0,"t":"Hair Moisturizer Great","x":"Left my hair soft and great scent. Just wish was cheaper but worth it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-8","r":1.0,"t":"This is not the real product So Disappointed","x":"on a previous review for this brand but another product.  Cause me to itch uncontrollable and cause bumps on my scalp this product cannot be what is normally purchased in a store.  Shortly after I purchased more products from my local drug store and had no issues.  Do not buy this product I am sure it is a knock off it was really hard on me.  I would have requested a refund but it was out of the window, unfortunately, these types of products do not affect you within a quick amount of time so you","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-9","r":1.0,"t":"Disliked everything about the product","x":"I have medium length 4c hair and my boyfriend has short 4b/4c hair. This product did not detangle my hair at all. After applying, my hair did not get any softer and it did not get more manageable. This product dried out both my boyfriend's and my hair. After applying, this product made our hair drier and tougher than it was prior to applying. There was nothing conditioning about this conditioner at all. I would give this product 0 stars. None of the claims the company made were true for our hair","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-10","r":3.0,"t":"not too excited about this shampoo. I will use ...","x":"not too excited about this shampoo. I will use it, but not re purchase. I have hair on the dry side and wavy /curls... and nothing to remark about this shampoo.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-11","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful!!","x":"This stuff is great, leaves my hair hydrated and soft. The curls are definitely poppin!! My hair is very managable and easy to comb.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-12","r":5.0,"t":"Truly detangling","x":"I have type 4, thick low porosity hair. And I have struggled for years to find a really detangling conditioner. This one is really nice. For the first time in years I was able to brush through my hair. Aldo to me it's not extremely moisturizing, it is hydrating.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-13","r":4.0,"t":"Mane moisturizer detangling creme","x":"Like this detangle n moisturizer for hair which works as it states on bottle really a good buy n use it weekly less hsir washing done","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-14","r":5.0,"t":"Smells so good","x":"It smells so good, I wanted to put everything on my hair. It was recommended by a friend so I have high expectations.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-15","r":1.0,"t":"To thick unuseable","x":"I have tried everything and it will not come out of it's bottle.  Very frustrating.  I feel like I got robbed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-16","r":3.0,"t":"Not a good Detangler","x":"Not bad but It does not do a good job at detangling and I have to use so much just to spread through my hair","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product!","x":"Would recommend for curly hair.  Makes my daughters hair super curly and conditioned","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-18","r":3.0,"t":"Not Sure","x":"Wanted something that will help hair grow. Not sure if this is helping.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-19","r":5.0,"t":"\u2698\ud83d\udc9c\ud83c\udf39\u2764\u270c","x":"Get into it  The Mane Choice ur hair will grow strong","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-20","r":5.0,"t":"Happy customer","x":"Love how this product makes my hair feel!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-21","r":1.0,"t":"It smells horrible to me.","x":"I hate this. I don't know if I got a bad batch or what but it does not smell good. This was my first time buying this mane choice conditioner and It will be the last. I had high hopes for it based on reviews but it was a big let down. I've tried using it three times, once a month since I've bought it and I can't get past the smell. It stinks and I can't bring myself to apply it to my hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-22","r":5.0,"t":"TOP OF THE LINE CONDITIONER","x":"I'm really impressed with this product! My girl put me on this conditioner and my afro stays moisturized for a long period of time. I don't see too much dryness and flakiness out of my hair anymore. The products are light and smell really good. If I could give this conditioner 10 stars I would.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-23","r":5.0,"t":"I really works!","x":"Okay, I'm a baby boomer with white hair. It used to be red and very curly.  Now it's just frizzy. None of the Frizz shampoo / conditioners really work. But thanks to Mane Choice it really looks great again. No frizz and curls that stay. I love it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B01ETV11XU-24","r":1.0,"t":"The tangling detangler.","x":"As with the shampoo I reviewed, I say the same about the conditioner. Although it may work for some people, the conditioner did not meet up to the standards I had hoped for and actually left my hair much more difficult to handle.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers say the product leaves hair soft, moisturized, and easier to detangle.","cites":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the scent and overall pleasant experience.","cites":[8,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the product is pricey but still worth it.","cites":[5,8]},{"text":"A small number of reviewers report negative results, including itching, bumps, and dried-out hair.","cites":[9,10]},{"text":"One reviewer was unimpressed with the shampoo and would not repurchase.","cites":[11]}]},"qa":[]}